Goal: Allow admins to push live promotional popups and alert notifications dynamically without modifying any code, mimicking top-tier apps.
Backend Changes (core_service):
Models: Add MarketingCampaign model in Django containing title, subtitle, content, image URL, CTA text, CTA redirect link, start/end dates, active status, and user_targeting filters (ALL, NO_INVESTMENTS, DEBTORS).
API: Register /api/marketing/active/ to fetch campaigns. Backend filters records based on user profile logic (e.g. if target is NO_INVESTMENTS, check if user has active assets).
Notifications Engine: Create a lightweight notification system. Whenever an expense transaction is added, check if current category monthly totals exceed 80% or 100% of the category Budget limit. If so, trigger a database Notification record.
Frontend Web Changes (client):
Hero Net Worth Card: Display total live Net Worth dynamically. Add a beautiful SVG glow progress ring representing dynamic user goals.
Notification Bell: Add a premium bell icon on the dashboard displaying active alerts. Show instant slide-in toast warnings when a budget is crossed.
Ad Popups: Integrate MarketingPopup.jsx overlay on the Dashboard. Queries active campaigns, respects dismiss states stored in localStorage, and triggers high-end entrance and exit animations.
