Auth & SMTP Flow Check: Register a test account, check console/real inbox for dynamic HTML verification email, verify OTP, login, and confirm that only this user's data is shown on dashboard APIs.
Interactive Entry Forms: Add new records via UI slide-in modal and confirm dynamic DB storage and list reloads.
Targeted Campaigns & Alerts: Create a targeted campaign in Django Admin, open the React dashboard, check if the popup renders based on targeting criteria, and test budget overflow toast alerts.
Gemini AI Audit: Trigger AI audit chatbot and verify markdown layout returns complete, personalized advice.
Mobile APK Verification: Load the React Native client on an Android device/emulator, mock a bank SMS, check instant offline SQLite storage, and watch it synchronize smoothly to the Django API backend.
